Use whatever you /do/ have, and adjust for whatever monsters are in
the room.  E.g. if you do nothing, the crowd will catch up with you,
surround and kill you.  Ideas:

- Elbereth
- sleep
- dig your way past (preferably with the wand or spell)
- invisibility
- speed
- ?oTeleport (bring a few uncursed ones, let the crowd chase you until
  they form a clump, then teleport around until you're close to the
  stairs down)
- /oTeleport (at yourself, or that single elf lord between you and the
  stairs)
- conflict
- combinations

Many of these have the drawback that the danger is still there and your
way to the mines is blocked.  They may also leave the bigroom a /more/
dangerous place if the monsters now clump around the stairs.

